            "text": "第1問　整数・場合の数・接円・三角関数（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "1)",
                "value": "60，72，84"
              },
              {
                "label": "2)(a)",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{1}{6}(n+3)(n+2)(n+1)\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "2)(b)",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{1}{6}(n+1)n(n-1)\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "3)(a)",
                "value": "\\((1+t,\\sqrt{3}t)\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "3)(b)",
                "value": "\\(P\\left(\\frac{23}{11},\\frac{12\\sqrt{3}}{11}\\right),\\;r=\\frac{2}{11}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "4)(a)",
                "value": "\\(-4t^3+3t\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "4)(b)",
                "value": "\\(-\\frac{4}{3}t^3+3t\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "4)(c)",
                "value": "最大値 \\(\\frac{4}{3}\\ (x=0)\\)，最小値 \\(-\\sqrt{3}\\ \\left(x=\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\right)\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "1)　約数の個数から指数の形を決める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "正の約数が12個になる素因数の指数は \\(11\\)、\\(5,1\\)、\\(3,2\\)、\\(2,1,1\\) のいずれかです。小さい素数を大きい指数へ割り当てます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2^2\\cdot3\\cdot5=60,\\qquad2^3\\cdot3^2=72,\\qquad2^2\\cdot3\\cdot7=84",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "他の指数型の最小候補とも比較すると、小さい順の3個は \\(60,72,84\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "2)(a)　重複組合せへ読み替える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(n\\) 個の同じものを4種類へ分けると考えます。4変数がすべて0以上なので重複組合せを使えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_4H_n={}_{n+3}C_3=\\frac16(n+3)(n+2)(n+1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "2)(b)　自然数条件を0以上へ戻す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "変換の理由",
            "text": "\\(a,b\\) は1以上です。\\(a'=a-1,b'=b-1\\) と置けば、4変数がすべて0以上になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a'+b'+c+d=n-2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_4H_{n-2}={}_{n+1}C_3=\\frac16(n+1)n(n-1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "3)(a)　中心Pを直線CB上に置く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C=(1,0),\\quad\\overrightarrow{CP}=t\\overrightarrow{CB}=t(1,\\sqrt3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P=C+t(B-C)=(1+t,\\sqrt3t)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a1-three-circles",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "3)(b)　内接・外接を中心間距離に直す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "円O3はO1に内接し、O2に外接します。したがって中心間距離と半径の関係は次の2式です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "OP+r=3,\\qquad CP-r=2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "OP+CP=5",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt{(1+t)^2+3t^2}+2t=5",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t=\\frac{12}{11}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P=\\left(\\frac{23}{11},\\frac{12\\sqrt3}{11}\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r=2t-2=\\frac2{11}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "4)(a)　角のずれを3倍角へ反映する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=\\alpha-\\frac\\pi3\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\cos3x=\\cos(3\\alpha-\\pi)=-\\cos3\\alpha",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos3x=-4t^3+3t",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "4)(b)　三角関数の合成でtへそろえる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos x-\\sqrt3\\sin x=2\\cos\\left(x+\\frac\\pi3\\right)=2t",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=\\frac13(-4t^3+3t)+2t=-\\frac43t^3+3t",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "4)(c)　置換後の定義域を先に確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "0\\le x\\le\\pi\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\frac\\pi3\\le\\alpha\\le\\frac{4\\pi}3\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad-1\\le t\\le\\frac12",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "g(t)=-\\frac43t^3+3t,\\qquad g'(t)=-4t^2+3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "端点と \\(g'(t)=0\\) の候補を調べ、最後に \\(t=\\cos\\alpha\\)、\\(x=\\alpha-\\pi/3\\) へ戻します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\max f=\\frac43\\qquad(x=0)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\min f=-\\sqrt3\\qquad\\left(x=\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{5\\pi}6\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　二次単数の漸化式と直線の傾きの極限（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "答えは、1) \\(x_{n+1}=2x_n+3y_n,\\ y_{n+1}=x_n+2y_n\\)、2) \\(x_n^2-3y_n^2=1\\)、3) \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}k_n=1/\\sqrt3\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "1)　(2+√3)を1回掛ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(2+\\sqrt3)^{n+1}=(2+\\sqrt3)(x_n+\\sqrt3y_n)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=(2x_n+3y_n)+\\sqrt3(x_n+2y_n)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "係数比較",
            "text": "有理数部分と \\(\\sqrt3\\) の係数をそれぞれ比較します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x_{n+1}=2x_n+3y_n,\\qquad y_{n+1}=x_n+2y_n",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "2)　二次式の不変量を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x_{n+1}^2-3y_{n+1}^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=(2x_n+3y_n)^2-3(x_n+2y_n)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=x_n^2-3y_n^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "この値はnによらず一定です。\\(x_1=2,y_1=1\\) を代入します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x_n^2-3y_n^2=x_1^2-3y_1^2=1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "3)　まずxn/ynの極限を求める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(\\frac{x_n}{y_n}\\right)^2=3+\\frac1{y_n^2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(x_n,y_n>0\\) で \\(y_n\\to\\infty\\) なので、正の平方根を取ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{x_n}{y_n}=\\sqrt3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "k_n=\\frac{y_{n+1}-y_n}{x_{n+1}-x_n}=\\frac{x_n+y_n}{x_n+3y_n}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}k_n=\\frac{\\sqrt3+1}{\\sqrt3+3}=\\frac1{\\sqrt3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　球面と平面の交円・距離最大（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "答えは、1) \\(\\sqrt{10}\\)、2) \\(H=(7/3,2/3,-5/3)\\)、3) \\(Q=((7+\\sqrt{13})/3,(2-\\sqrt{13})/3,(-5-2\\sqrt{13})/3)\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "1)　球面の式を平方完成する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(x-3)^2+y^2+(z+1)^2=10",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "中心は \\(P=(3,0,-1)\\)、半径は \\(\\sqrt{10}\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a3-plane-foot",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "2)　平面上の点を2変数で表す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{AB}=(1,1,0),\\qquad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(1,-1,-2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{AH}=s\\overrightarrow{AB}+t\\overrightarrow{AC}=(s+t,s-t,-2t)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "垂直条件",
            "text": "\\(PH\\) は平面αに垂直です。したがって平面内の独立な2方向 \\(AB,AC\\) のどちらとも内積が0です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{PH}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=0,\\qquad\\overrightarrow{PH}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "s=2,\\qquad t=\\frac43",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "H=\\left(\\frac73,\\frac23,-\\frac53\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "3)　交円Kの中心と半径を決める",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "球面を平面で切った交円の中心は、球の中心から平面へ下ろした足Hです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{PH}=-\\frac23(1,-1,1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r_K^2=10-|PH|^2=10-\\frac43=\\frac{26}3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a3-sphere-plane-circle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "平面内の正規直交基底で円周を表す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\mathbf e_1=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}(1,1,0)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\mathbf e_2=\\frac1{\\sqrt6}(1,-1,-2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{HQ}=\\frac{\\sqrt{26}}{\\sqrt3}(\\mathbf e_1\\cos\\theta+\\mathbf e_2\\sin\\theta)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "距離の読み替え",
            "text": "xy平面との距離は \\(|z|\\) です。したがってQのz成分の絶対値を最大にします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|Q_z|=\\left|-\\frac53-\\frac{2\\sqrt{13}}3\\sin\\theta\\right|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "係数と中心値の符号から \\(\\sin\\theta=1\\) のとき絶対値が最大です。このとき \\(\\cos\\theta=0\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q=H+\\frac{\\sqrt{26}}{\\sqrt3}\\mathbf e_2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q=\\left(\\frac{7+\\sqrt{13}}3,\\frac{2-\\sqrt{13}}3,\\frac{-5-2\\sqrt{13}}3\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "別解　平面上の2変数からzの範囲を出す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本は平面上の点を \\(\\overrightarrow{AQ}=l\\overrightarrow{AB}+m\\overrightarrow{AC}\\) と表す別解も示しています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q=(l+m-1,l-m,-2m+1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "l^2+3m^2-4l-8m+5=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(l-2)^2+3\\left(m-\\frac43\\right)^2=\\frac{13}3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "この楕円形の制約からmの最大値を取り、\\(z=-2m+1\\) を最小にすれば主解法と同じ点Qを得ます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "aichi-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "答案の要点",
            "text": "主解法では、交円Kの中心がHであること、平面α内の互いに垂直な単位ベクトル2本を選ぶこと、距離をz成分の絶対値へ読み替えることを明記します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a3-unit-circle-parameterization",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "別解を使う場合は、球面の式へ代入して得た2変数の二次式を平方完成し、mの範囲からzの範囲を求める流れを省略しないことが大切です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
